  "notes": "Anglophone subsystem (Law No. 98/004 of 14 April 1998, art. 15): majority in the North-West and South-West regions, with schools nationwide. Primary ends with the First School Leaving Certificate; Form 5 with the GCE Ordinary Level and Upper Sixth with the GCE Advanced Level (MINESEC: 5-year first cycle, 2-year second cycle). Anglophone technical secondary runs 4 + 3 years."
